{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-10-1","title":"John 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ is the door, and the good shepherd. 19 Divers opinions of him. 23 He proves by his works that he is Christ the Son of God; 31 escapes the Jews; 39 and goes again beyond Jordan, where many believe on him.</p>\n<p>Verily. 3:3 He. 9; Jer 14:15; 23:16,17,21,32; 28:15-17; 29:31,32; Eze 13:2-6 Mt 7:15; 23:16-28 Ro 10:15; Eph 4:8-12; Heb 5:4; 1Pe 1:10; 2Pe 2:1; 1Jo 4:1 the same. 8,10; Isa 56:10-12; Eze 34:2-5; Zec 11:4,5,16,17; Ro 16:18 2Co 11:13-15; Tit 1:11; 2Pe 2:3,14-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-10-2","title":"John 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>he that. 7,9; Ac 20:28; 1Ti 3:2-7; 4:14; Tit 1:5; Re 1:20; 2:1 the shepherd. 11,12,14; Ps 23:1; 80:1; Ec 12:11; Isa 40:11; 63:11; Eze 34:23 Mic 5:5; Zec 11:3,5,8; 13:7; Heb 13:20; 1Pe 2:25; 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-10-3","title":"John 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the porter. Isa 53:10-12; 1Co 16:9; Col 4:3; 1Pe 1:12; Re 3:7,8,20 the sheep. 4,16,26,27; 6:37,45; So 8:13 and he. 14,27; Ex 33:17; Ro 8:30; Php 4:3; 2Ti 2:19; Re 20:15 and leadeth. Ps 23:2,3; 78:52,53; 80:1; Isa 40:11; 42:16; 49:9,10; Jer 31:8,9 Jer 50:4-6; Eze 34:11-16; Re 7:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-10-4","title":"John 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>he goeth. 12:26; 13:15; 14:2,3; De 1:30; Mic 2:12,13; Mt 16:24; 1Co 11:1 Eph 5:1; Php 2:5-11; Heb 6:20; 12:2; 1Pe 2:21; 4:1; 5:3 for. 8,16; 3:29; 18:37; So 2:8; 5:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-10-5","title":"John 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"c